{{!--
  Dragonbane — the back of every card type.

  Like front.hbs it renders PLACES, each named after where it sits:

    back-header-title      big green display title, top      ALWAYS
    back-image-primary     the illustration
    back-footer-title      small parchment plaque, bottom    OPTIONAL

  Unlike the front's places, these are filled once at SYSTEM level: every
  Dragonbane card type answers them identically — `category` over
  `subcategory`, family over shelf, AUSRÜSTUNG over „Kleidung". A card type
  that wants a different answer overrides the binding in its own entry.

  ONE arrangement, modelled on the deck's captioned backs ("IMPROVISIERTE
  WAFFEN" over "GASTHAUS"). The deck also prints an uncaptioned variant with
  the title BELOW the illustration ("SCHATZFUND", "ABENTEUER", "INITIATIVE").
  Every card puts the title on top instead, so the backs of a mixed deck
  read as one series and a fanned-out hand shows its titles in the same
  place. The caption plaque is the only optional part.

  `back-header-title` falls back to the card type's `back-label` — the roll
  table's own name ("Dämonenwurf im Nahkampf", "Furcht", "Jagdbeute") reaches
  it through the place, because one generic card type serves every table and
  the caption therefore has to come from the card's data rather than from
  the card type's translations.

  `back-footer-title` prints only when it names something OTHER than the
  header — repeating the line above it one size down would read as a mistake.

  The illustration is whatever the card type binds to `back-image-primary`.
  `back-image` is bound there system-wide (a vault image chosen per card),
  and the creature card type binds its `artwork` behind it, because a
  creature's picture serves both faces; `back-image` is bound FIRST, so an
  explicit back picture always wins. Without either the wrap carries
  `db-back-emblem` and the stylesheet paints the deck's emblem into it — a
  d20 in a ring of the ornament green; a card type with a back of its own
  (gear) paints its own picture under the same class.
--}}
<div class="card-root card-back dragonbane {{card-type}}-card {{card-type}}-back">
  <div class="db-strip db-strip-top"></div>

  <div class="db-back-category"><span class="text-scalable">{{slot "back-header-title" plain=true fallback=(t "back-label")}}</span></div>

  <div class="db-back-image-wrap{{#unless (slot "back-image-primary")}} db-back-emblem{{/unless}}">
    {{#if (slot "back-image-primary")}}
      <img class="db-back-image fade-edges" src="{{slot "back-image-primary" image=true}}" />
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  {{#if (slot "back-footer-title")}}
  {{#unless (eq (slot "back-header-title" plain=true fallback=(t "back-label")) (slot "back-footer-title" plain=true))}}
  <div class="db-plaque-strip db-plaque-caption db-back-subcategory">
    <span class="db-plaque-end db-plaque-end-left"></span>
    <span class="db-plaque-text">{{slot "back-footer-title" markdown=false}}</span>
    <span class="db-plaque-end db-plaque-end-right"></span>
  </div>
  {{/unless}}
  {{/if}}

  <div class="db-strip db-strip-bottom"></div>
</div>
